  "description": "<p data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"311\">De Sony PlayStation 4 Original is een veelzijdige spelcomputer met een uitgebreid aanbod aan exclusieve en populaire games. Dankzij de 500GB opslagcapaciteit en de meegeleverde controller kun je direct aan de slag met gamen, streamen en entertainment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"339\"><strong data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"322\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"325\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"551\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"356\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"359\">⭐ Groot aanbod PlayStation 4-games<br data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"396\">⭐ Geschikt voor gaming en multimedia<br data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"435\">⭐ Inclusief draadloze controller<br data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"470\">⭐ Eenvoudig online spelen via PlayStation Network<br data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"522\">⭐ Direct klaar voor gebruik</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"939\">📋 <strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"573\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"576\"><strong data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"585\">Type:</strong> Spelcomputer<br data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"601\"><strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"611\">Model:</strong> Sony PlayStation 4 Original<br data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"642\"><strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"653\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Opslag:</strong> 500GB HDD<br data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"666\"><strong data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"680\">Processor:</strong> AMD 8-core processor<br data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"704\"><strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"724\">Grafische kaart:</strong> AMD Radeon Graphics<br data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"747\"><strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"766\">Connectiviteit:</strong> WiFi, Bluetooth, USB, HDMI, Ethernet<br data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"806\"><strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"825\">Optische drive:</strong> Blu-ray drive<br data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"842\"><strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"857\">Controller:</strong> DualShock 4 draadloze controller<br data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"893\"><strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"903\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart<br data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"912\"><strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"922\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1063\">📦 <strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"959\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"962\">Sony PlayStation 4 Original<br data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"992\">DualShock 4 Controller<br data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1017\">HDMI-kabel<br data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1030\">Voedingskabel<br data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1046\">USB-oplaadkabel</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1124\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1087\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1090\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maanden garantie</p>",
